            "notes": "You can go either  [Evasive Maneuvers](item_3725ca88-f12a-4a00-8878-4fa39a18a394)  or  [Extra Charge](item_a5aa16ee-5a80-4e1b-b585-2c4d12575b7a) it depends on your ability to get value. \nWhatever you don't get get it in round 5.\n\nBy now you should have your core damage up and the slow from  [Helix Inhibitor](item_0cdf922e-b43f-4b8f-bf2b-0127d1ed2f7d) is a core need.\n\nIf you are getting shot out of the sky play better, or get defense based upon what is happening, where the damage is coming from. \n  [Skyline Nanites](item_0b334927-da04-42d6-8dfd-96e7b6c1cd51)  is also great if you have extra charge as it will proc this damage from the vertical boop.",
